---
const title = "Privacy Policy";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#06121d" />
    <meta name="description" content="Privacy policy for proxylabs.gg." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://proxylabs.gg/privacy/" />
    <title>{title} &middot; Proxylabs.gg</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <a class="back" href="/">&larr; Back</a>
      <h1>{title}</h1>
      <p class="effective">Effective August 20, 2026</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This site is operated by Proxylabs.gg LLC, a Utah limited liability
        company. You can reach us at
        <a href="mailto:support@proxylabs.gg">support@proxylabs.gg</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        If you join the early access list, we collect the email address you
        submit. The signup form is protected by Cloudflare Turnstile, which
        processes limited technical information to distinguish people from
        bots; see
        <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">
          Cloudflare&rsquo;s privacy policy</a
        > for details. We do not use advertising trackers on this site.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your email address to send updates about Wakewalkers early
        access and availability. We do not sell your email address. It is
        stored with the service providers we use to operate the list and is
        not shared with anyone else.
      </p>

      <h2>Removal</h2>
      <p>
        To be removed from the list at any time, email
        <a href="mailto:support@proxylabs.gg">support@proxylabs.gg</a> and we
        will delete your address.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy changes, we will update this page and its effective
        date.
      </p>

      <footer>&copy; 2026 Proxylabs.gg LLC</footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: dark;
  }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100svh;
    background: #06121d;
    color: #f7ead0;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  main {
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 3rem;
  }
  h1 {
    color: #fff7e8;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 1rem 0 0.25rem;
  }
  h2 {
    color: #fff7e8;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0.25rem;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
  }
  .effective {
    color: #a7b0b4;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  a {
    color: #f5c65f;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .back {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .back:hover,
  .back:focus-visible {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  footer {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    color: #a7b0b4;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
</style>
